  "vibe": "Pale sky #dce8ea over a sea-green #2e6e63 horizon, with safety orange #e8641f reserved for whatever is live. Michroma's wide squared caps set every title uppercase at 0.03em tracking; Saira carries the data. The world is a working offshore array: three white towers at different scales, rotors turning at different speeds, orange nacelle hubs, white swells scrolling left in parallax, a gull riding a slow sine, and a WIND 14 KN readout in the top corner whose number actually changes. Nothing tilts — montage tiles sit at exactly zero degrees, chips are square, corners are 12–16px. Its own beats are a 2×2 of rotary dials whose needles sweep to position, a terminal typing the 06:00 check, and a split-flap live meter.",
